# Reply summary format

After finishing a set of code or config changes in a turn, end the reply with a summary in exactly this format:

```markdown
**Summary** Short title
One sentence under 25 words describing what changed and why.
```

Rules:

- `**Summary**` is bold, then a short title on the same line (a few words).
- The next line is a single description under 25 words.
- Cover the outcome, not a file laundry list.
- Skip the summary only when no changes were made (e.g. pure Q&A).

Example:

```markdown
**Summary** Destination photo fix
Replaced the shared travel flatlay so Discover and Wishlist cards show distinct city images.
```
